Trailing comma except for last
  keep-sorted-test start
  1,
  2,
  3
  keep-sorted-test end


Trailing comma and a comment
  # keep-sorted-test start
  1,
  2,
  3  # three
  # keep-sorted-test end

Trailing comma except for last, last has a comment
  # keep-sorted-test start
  1,
  2, # two
  3
  # keep-sorted-test end

Trailing comma and a comment, last has a comment
  # keep-sorted-test start
  1,
  2, # two
  3  # three
  # keep-sorted-test end

Trailing comments aligned by a formatter
  // keep-sorted-test start
  "aaa",  // a
  "bbb",  // b
  "zzz"   // z
  // keep-sorted-test end

Comment marker inside a string
  // keep-sorted-test start
  "https://a.example.com",  // a
  "https://z.example.com"   // z
  // keep-sorted-test end

Blank line and no trailing comma after the last element
  keep-sorted-test start

  1,
  2,
  3
  keep-sorted-test end

Blank line between the last element and a trailing comment
  # keep-sorted-test start
  "a",
  "b",
  "c",

  # Insert new elements above.
  # keep-sorted-test end

Trailing comment wrapped onto the next line by a formatter
  // keep-sorted-test start
  "a",
  "b",
  "c"   // A comment that a formatter
        // wrapped.
  // keep-sorted-test end

Wrapped trailing comment on the last element
  // keep-sorted-test start
  "a",  // A comment that a formatter
        // wrapped.
  "b"
  // keep-sorted-test end
